OL,3,ATrump rejects Iran deal to reopen
OL,4,AStrait of Hormuz in seven days
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has rejected
OL,7,Fan Iranian proposal to reopen the
OL,8,FStrait of Hormuz to commercial shipping
OL,9,Fwithin a week.
OL,11,FHe told reporters at the White House
OL,12,Fthat Tehran "want to make a deal where
OL,13,Fthey open the Strait immediately
OL,14,Fbecause they're losing so badly".
OL,16,FOn Friday, Iran's Foreign Minister
OL,17,FAbbas Araghchi told reporters at the UN
OL,18,Fin New York that agreement could be
OL,19,Freached "if the necessary conditions
OL,20,Fare met" and that these were contained
OL,21,Fin a memorandum of understanding (MOU)
OL,22,Fsigned by the two countries in June.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
