OL,3,ATrump rejects Iran deal to reopen
OL,4,AStrait of Hormuz in seven days
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vital waterway through which around
OL,7,Fa fifth of the world's gas and oil
OL,8,Fsupply usually flows has been
OL,9,Feffectively closed since the outbreak
OL,10,Fof war in February.
